        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Justinian I</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 482 CE – 565 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">Around 482, according to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/procopius">Procopius</a> in the hamlet of Tauresium in Dardania; of a peasant family thought to be of Thraco-Roman or Illyro-Roman origin, nephew of the future emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/justin-i">Justin I</a></span></div>
