          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/corpus-juris-civilis">Corpus Juris Civilis</a>; the reconquest of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/north-africa">North Africa</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a> and southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hispania">Hispania</a>; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hagia-sophia">Hagia Sophia</a>; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nika-riots">Nika riots</a>; wars with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasanian-empire">Sasanian Empire</a>; enforcing Chalcedonian orthodoxy; the Plague of Justinian</span></div>
